        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion BD-D6, Venetian Lever With Victorian Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe old world detailing of this leverset made by Fusion can be seen from the delicate swirling on the Victorian Plate all the way to the ornateness of the Venetian Lever. Made out of solid brass, it is available in oil rubbed and medium bronze finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. This elaborately decorated lever and plate set radiates the attention to detail one might expect to see on the even most beautiful buildings of antiquity.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/victorian-entry-plate-fusion-e-d6\"><b>Matching Victorian Keyed Entry Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion BD-D6 Victorian Plate and Venetian Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>\"Positive Stop\" lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Old World Door Lever Fusion BD D6:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection:  1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass or Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Venetian Lever With Victorian Plate, Fusion BD-D6",
                "description": "Venetian Lever with Victorian Rose Fusion BD-D6 - The old world detailing of this leverset made by Fusion can be seen from the delicate swirling on the Victorian Plate all the way to the ornateness of the Venetian Lever. Made out of solid brass, it is available in Oil Rubbed and Medium Bronze finishes. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. This elaborately decorated lever and plate set radiates the attention to detail one might expect to see on the even most beautiful buildings of antiquity.",
